  => NEW EQUATION (from the action):  p_d = (2 pi G / mu^2) rho_d^2 ,  c_s^2 = |Psi| c^2 in a static well.
     The AeST Q-sector dust is a gamma=2 polytrope; DS24's Helmholtz phase is its Bernoulli constant / mass.

